# Hoisted (flat) node_modules for the workspace. Front-End Instance Separation Plan, Phase 3:
# a single react/react-dom/next at the root so the shared react packages under packages/* (Icon,
# Metric, and the school screens) resolve ONE react instance — the thing that lets owner-web and
# staff-web share React components instead of duplicating them. Hoisted also keeps NestJS's root
# deps resolving exactly as before, and is the pnpm layout Next handles most reliably.
node-linker=hoisted
